      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This will never happen because if uploading a Quest version of the world disables networked IK, noone will build quest content anymore since everyone except VRC devs hates network IK.\n\nIf they make it so that it only kicks in when a Quest user joins, then that user becomes a target for abuse and being kicked because they just caused everyone in the instance to use a broken IK system.",
